Implemented Cloudflare Tunnel support and pushed to `main`.

- Added `cloudflare` / `cloudflared` options to `.github/workflows/run.yml`.
- Added `scripts/cloudflare-tunnel.sh` with quick and named tunnel modes, access-proxy verification, and bore fallback.
- Added documentation, `.gitignore` rules, and `.agent-work/tests/test_cloudflare_tunnel.sh`.
- Validated shell syntax, YAML, shellcheck, fake quick/named tests, existing tunnel tests, and a live quick tunnel (`HTTP/1.0 200 OK`).

Commits: `0427ee2`, `57082d4`. Issue comment posted: https://github.com/promikailamin/ultron_smp/issues/19#issuecomment-6984101756

Note: Cloudflare TCP requires players to use Modflared or `cloudflared access tcp`, not a direct `hostname:25565` connection.
